# Afiche — environment variables template
# Copy this file to .env.local for local dev (gitignored).
# Never commit .env.local or real credentials.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database (libSQL / Turso-compatible)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# For local dev, point at a local SQLite file:
#     DATABASE_URL=file:./local.db
# For Turso cloud, use the libsql URL from your Turso dashboard:
#     DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-db.turso.io
#     DATABASE_AUTH_TOKEN=your-auth-token
DATABASE_URL=file:./local.db
DATABASE_AUTH_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TMDB (for poster art + canonical film IDs)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get a v4 Read Access Token at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# Free tier: plenty for this project.
TMDB_API_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anthropic API (Cine Lorca's image-based cartelera + the self-heal judge)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lorca publishes its weekly schedule as a JPEG only. We send the image to
# Claude vision and parse the structured response. The same key drives the
# self-heal judge (`npm run db:self-heal`), which reads the unmatched tail after
# a scrape. No other provider needs it. Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Revalidation webhook (hit by GitHub Actions scraper after each run)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generate a random string:  openssl rand -hex 32
REVALIDATE_SECRET=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Admin panel (operator UI at /admin/* — solo BDFL, single shared secret)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Password the operator types at /admin/login. Also used as the HMAC key
# for signing the 30-day session cookie (afiche_admin_session). Pick a
# long random value — recovery is "edit the env var" so length costs you
# nothing. Generate one with:  openssl rand -base64 32
#
# Required on Vercel preview + production before deploying the panel
# (otherwise login throws "ADMIN_SECRET env var is missing or empty").
ADMIN_SECRET=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Self-heal loop kill switches (optional — all default ON)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Each stage of the post-scrape self-heal loop can be paused without a code
# change or a cron edit. A stage is OFF only on an explicit falsy value
# (0/false/off/no); unset or empty means the default. See
# docs/agents/self-heal-loop.md.
#
# SELF_HEAL_ENABLED=        master switch for the whole self-heal run
# SELF_HEAL_APPLY_ENABLED=  auto-apply overrides (off = judge + queue only)
# LAYER2_ISSUES_ENABLED=    open matcher-pattern GitHub issues
# ACTOR2_ENABLED=           run the Actor 2 fix automation
